flowchart TD
    Start([Doctor opens X-Ray Analysis]) --> Upload[Upload panoramic and/or cephalogram]
    Upload --> CheckPan{Panoramic provided?}
    CheckPan -->|Yes| PanAPI[Call AnalyzePanoramicAsync]
    CheckPan -->|No| CheckCeph
    PanAPI --> CheckCeph{Cephalogram provided?}
    CheckCeph -->|No| SavePartial[Persist partial results]
    CheckCeph -->|Yes| CephLM[Call AnalyzeCephLandmarksAsync]
    CephLM --> CvmAPI[Call AnalyzeCvmAsync]
    CvmAPI --> CephSum[Call AnalyzeCephAsync with landmarks]
    CephSum --> CheckFull{Panoramic and ceph summary available?}
    CheckFull -->|Yes| FullCase[Call AnalyzeFullCaseAsync]
    CheckFull -->|No| CheckGemma
    FullCase --> CheckGemma{DentalGemma enabled?}
    CheckGemma -->|Yes| Gemma[Call AnalyzeDentalGemmaReportAsync]
    CheckGemma -->|No| SaveCase
    Gemma --> SaveCase[Save XRayAnalysisCase to database]
    SavePartial --> Display[Display results with overlays]
    SaveCase --> Display
    Display --> End([Doctor reviews measurements and report])
